  "title": "Creative apps filled the catalog",
  "summary": "A community harvest: 36 catalog and showcase updates spanning creative tools, bots, learning apps, and developer utilities.\n\nCommunity additions covered fashion collections, product listings, thumbnails, image editing, nail art, video hooks, and AI writing. A team update also gathered six submitted apps into the catalog and README, including several already added individually; it was a showcase consolidation, not six more distinct apps.\n\nThe catalog gained a YouTube-comment summarizer, a job-post aggregator, Facebook post automation, two AI chat experiences, and a Khmer-language Telegram bot with image generation.\n\nNew catalog entries turn YouTube playlists into courses, offer AI language exercises, help run Dungeons & Dragons sessions, and create music-reactive Pixoo64 visuals through Home Assistant.",
